    <briefdescription>
<para>Configuration for a canary rollout. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Constraints (from module ROADMAP):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Cross-node coordination is NOT implemented here; each node runs its own canary controller and the <computeroutput>node_id</computeroutput> hash determines membership.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1updates_1_1_hot_reload_engine" kindref="compound">HotReloadEngine</ref> is used for the actual file-level update; callers must not run concurrent updates. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
